{
  "slug": "dominodatalab",
  "name": "Dominodatalab",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full Domino Data Lab platform support — workspaces, jobs, model deployment, experiment tracking, GenAI tracing, Spark/Ray/Dask, and app deployment for data science teams",
  "longDescription": "Ships **23 skills**, **3 agents**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (23): `ai-gateway` (Access external LLM providers through Domino AI Gateway - a secure proxy with centralized API key management, usage…), `apps` (Deploy web applications to Domino Data Lab with expertise in React apps (Vite) behind Domino's reverse proxy), `data-connectivity` (Connect Domino workloads to external data sources including AWS S3 (via Mountpoint CSI driver), credential propagation with AWS…), `datasets` (Work with Domino Datasets - high-performance, versioned filesystem storage), `distributed-computing` (Work with distributed computing frameworks in Domino including Apache Spark, Ray, and Dask clusters), `domino-data-sdk` (Use the domino-data Python SDK (dominodatalab-data) for programmatic data access in Domino), `domino-governance` (Manage model risk governance in Domino using policies, bundles, and evidence), `domino-ui-bootstrap` (Bootstrap or retrofit a Vite + React 18 + TypeScript project so it uses the Domino design system…), and 15 more\n- **Agents** (3): `domino-debug` (Specialized agent for debugging Domino issues including app deployment problems, job failures, environment build errors, and connectivity issues), `domino-deploy` (Specialized agent for deploying applications, models, and endpoints to Domino), `domino-setup` (Specialized agent for setting up new Domino projects, environments, and configurations)\n- **Commands** (4): `domino-app-init` (Initialize a new Domino-ready web application with Vite+React, Streamlit, Dash, or Flask), `domino-debug-proxy` (Debug Domino proxy and routing issues for web applications), `domino-experiment-setup` (Set up MLflow experiment tracking for traditional ML), `domino-trace-setup` (Set up GenAI tracing for an agent or LLM application)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `domino_server`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dominodatalab@claude-plugins-official` from `dominodatalab/domino-claude-plugin`.",
